WEBVTT

00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:30.401
Especially good is when
I see them inventing their own rules

00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:31.444
and their own worlds.

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:34.447
So here are my daughters,

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:35.782
last Saturday,

00:00:35.782 --> 00:00:38.534
making something out of different kits

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:39.744
and pieces of string

00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:42.455
and pieces of wood and dolls
and other objects.

00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:44.082
And I asked them, “What is it?”

00:00:44.332 --> 00:00:48.377
And they said to me, “Dad, of course
it’s a princess flying on a dragon

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:50.588
to visit farm animals in New York.”

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.007
Of course, what else could it be?

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:57.512
Kids at play inspire me.

00:00:57.637 --> 00:00:59.889
They’re not afraid to ask, “What if”

00:00:59.889 --> 00:01:00.890
and “Why not?”